{"ticker":{"symbol":"281740.KQ","name":"레이크머티리얼즈","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":11010.0,"change_pct":0.03283302063789861,"market_cap":723692945408.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.0027247956403269754,"week52_low":9200.0,"week52_high":28700.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","country":"South Korea","city":"Sejong City","employees":301,"website":"https://www.lakematerials.co.kr","business_summary":"Lake Materials Co., Ltd. develops and manufactures organometallic compounds that are used as materials for semiconductors, displays, solar applications, in South Korea. The company offers electronic materials for various semiconductors, displays, and LEDs; metallocene compound; and catalysts for petrochemical industries. Its products include trimethylgallium, trimethylaluminum, and trimethylindium; and fine chemical materials, metallocene catalysts, co-catalysts, supported catalysts, etc. used in the petrochemical field. The company was formerly known as Lake LED Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Lake Materials Co., Ltd. in April 2013. Lake Materials Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 2010 and is headquartered in Sejong City, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"레이크머티리얼즈(주)는 한국에서 반도체, 디스플레이, 태양광 응용 소재로 사용되는 유기금속 화합물을 개발 및 제조하는 회사입니다. 다양한 반도체, 디스플레이, LED용 전자재료를 제공하는 회사입니다. 메탈로센 화합물; 석유화학공업용 촉매 등이 있습니다. 해당 제품에는 트리메틸갈륨, 트리메틸알루미늄 및 트리메틸인듐이 포함됩니다. 석유화학분야에서 사용되는 정밀화학소재, 메탈로센촉매, 조촉매, 담지촉매 등이 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Lake LED Co., Ltd.로 알려졌으며 2013년 4월에 Lake Materials Co., Ltd.로 상호를 변경했습니다. Lake Materials Co., Ltd.는 2010년에 법인화되었으며 대한민국 세종시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"특수화학","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":131506715480.0,"operating_income":35391255180.0,"net_income":27009497730.0,"eps":411.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":117789811140.0,"operating_in